Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./Project.xlsx
--DCXLSBoundary--


### 9. Copy endpoint: same three fields, as optional JSON properties.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/CopyProyectFromTemplate
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceProjectId": "{{sourceProjectId}}",
  "targetProjectId": "{{targetProjectId}}",
  "environmentUrl": "{{envUrl}}",
  "environmentApiUrl": "{{envApiUrl}}",
  "cloud": "{{cloud}}"
}


### 10. Connectivity check against one specific environment (no import needed).
###     Expected: 200 with environment / cloud / authority in the body.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/TestConnection?environmentUrl={{envUrlHigh}}&environmentApiUrl={{envApiUrlHigh}}&cloud=GCCHigh
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}


### 11. Same check on the legacy environment (no query string).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/TestConnection
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
